WEBVTT

00:48:00.996 --> 00:48:05.246
My answer there is actually more about,

00:48:05.829 --> 00:48:09.246
like technical and societal
issues than the charter.

00:48:09.246 --> 00:48:12.288
So if it's OK for me to answer it
from that perspective, sure.

00:48:12.496 --> 00:48:14.829
OK, I'm happy to talk about
the charter to.

00:48:17.246 --> 00:48:21.704
I think this question of alignment
that we talked about

00:48:21.704 --> 00:48:23.746
a little earlier is paramount,

00:48:24.329 --> 00:48:29.371
and then I think to understand that it's
useful to differentiate between

00:48:29.746 --> 00:48:34.663
accidental misuse of a system and
intentional misuse of a system.